    "Allow As Needed to send you reminders for your medications. You can customize when and how often you receive notifications.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اسمح لتطبيق As Needed بإرسال تذكيرات لأدويتك. يمكنك تخصيص توقيت وتكرار الإشعارات."
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permet que As Needed t'enviï recordatoris per a les teves medicacions. Pots personalitzar quan i amb quina freqüència reps les notificacions."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Povolte As Needed, aby vám posílala připomenutí k vašim lékům. Můžete upravit, kdy a jak často dostávat oznámení."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tillad As Needed at sende dig påmindelser om dine medicin. Du kan tilpasse, hvornår og hvor ofte du modtager notifikationer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlaube As Needed, dir Erinnerungen für deine Medikamente zu senden. Du kannst einstellen, wann und wie oft du Benachrichtigungen erhältst."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Επιτρέψτε στο As Needed να στέλνει υπενθυμίσεις για τα φάρμακά σας. Μπορείτε να προσαρμόσετε πότε και πόσο συχνά λαμβάνετε ειδοποιήσεις."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow As Needed to send you reminders for your medications. You can customize when and how often you receive notifications."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow As Needed to send you reminders for your medications. You can customise when and how often you receive notifications."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow As Needed to send you reminders for your medications. You can customise when and how often you receive notifications."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permite que As Needed te envíe recordatorios de tus medicamentos. Puedes personalizar cuándo y con qué frecuencia recibes las notificaciones."
          }
        },
        "es-419": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permite que As Needed te envíe recordatorios para tus medicamentos. Puedes personalizar cuándo y con qué frecuencia recibes las notificaciones."
          }
        },
        "fa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اجازه دهید As Needed برای داروهای شما یادآوری ارسال کند. می‌توانید زمان و دفعات دریافت اعلان‌ها را شخصی‌سازی کنید."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Salli As Needed lähettää muistutuksia lääkkeistäsi. Voit mukauttaa, milloin ja kuinka usein saat ilmoituksia."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autoriser As Needed à t’envoyer des rappels pour tes médicaments. Tu peux personnaliser quand et à quelle fréquence recevoir les notifications."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autoriser As Needed à t’envoyer des rappels pour tes médicaments. Tu peux personnaliser quand et à quelle fréquence tu reçois des notifications."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "אפשר ל־As Needed לשלוח לך תזכורות על התרופות. ניתן להתאים מתי ובאיזו תדירות תקבל התראות."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As Needed को आपकी दवाओं के लिए अनुस्मारक भेजने की अनुमति दें। आप चुन सकते हैं कि आपको सूचनाएँ कब और कितनी बार मिलें।"
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Engedélyezd, hogy az As Needed emlékeztetőket küldjön a gyógyszereidről. Testreszabhatod, mikor és milyen gyakran kapj értesítéseket."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izinkan As Needed mengirimkan pengingat untuk obatmu. Kamu dapat menyesuaikan kapan dan seberapa sering menerima notifikasi."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Consenti ad As Needed di inviarti promemoria per i tuoi farmaci. Puoi personalizzare quando e con quale frequenza ricevere le notifiche."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As Neededが薬のリマインダーを送信できるように許可してください。通知のタイミングや頻度はカスタマイズできます。"
          }
        },
        "kk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow As Needed сізге дәрілер туралы ескертулер жіберсін. Хабарламаларды қашан және қаншалықты жиі алатыныңызды теңшеуге болады."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As Needed이(가) 약 복용 알림을 보낼 수 있도록 허용하세요. 알림을 받는 시기와 빈도는 사용자 설정으로 조정할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Benarkan As Needed menghantar peringatan untuk ubat-ubatan anda. Anda boleh menyesuaikan bila dan berapa kerap anda menerima pemberitahuan."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tillat As Needed å sende deg påminnelser for medisinene dine. Du kan tilpasse når og hvor ofte du mottar varsler."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sta As Needed toe je herinneringen voor je medicatie te sturen. Je kunt instellen wanneer en hoe vaak je meldingen ontvangt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pozwól As Needed wysyłać Ci przypomnienia o lekach. Możesz dostosować, kiedy i jak często otrzymujesz powiadomienia."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permita que o As Needed envie lembretes sobre seus medicamentos. Você pode personalizar quando e com que frequência recebe notificações."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permitir que As Needed te envie lembretes para as tuas medicações. Podes personalizar quando e com que frequência recebes notificações."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permite As Needed să îți trimită mementouri pentru medicamente. Poți personaliza când și cât de des primești notificări."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Разреши As Needed присылать тебе напоминания о приёме препаратов. Ты можешь настроить, когда и как часто получать уведомления."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tillåt As Needed att skicka påminnelser för dina mediciner. Du kan anpassa när och hur ofta du får notiser."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "อนุญาตให้ As Needed ส่งการเตือนสำหรับยาของคุณ คุณสามารถปรับเมื่อและความถี่ที่รับการแจ้งเตือนได้"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As Needed'in ilaçların için hatırlatmalar göndermesine izin ver. Bildirimleri ne zaman ve ne sıklıkla alacağını özelleştirebilirsin."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cho phép As Needed gửi nhắc nhở về thuốc cho bạn. Bạn có thể tùy chỉnh thời gian và tần suất nhận thông báo."
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許 As Needed 向你發送用藥提醒。你可自訂接收通知的時間及頻率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许 As Needed 向你发送用药提醒。你可以自定义接收通知的时间和频率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允許 As Needed 傳送藥物提醒給你。你可以自訂接收通知的時間與頻率。"
          }
        },
        "bg": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Разрешете на As Needed да ви изпраща напомняния за лекарствата ви. Можете да настроите кога и колко често да получавате известия."
          }
        },
        "hr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dopusti aplikaciji As Needed slanje podsjetnika za lijekove. Možeš prilagoditi vrijeme i učestalost primanja obavijesti."
          }
        },
        "sk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Povoľte aplikácii As Needed posielať vám pripomienky k liekom. Môžete si prispôsobiť, kedy a ako často budete dostávať hlásenia."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Дозвольте As Needed надсилати нагадування про ліки. Ви можете налаштувати час і частоту сповіщень."
          }
        }
      }
    },
