    "NLM urges you to consult with a qualified physician for advice about medications.": {
      "comment": "A note urging users to consult a healthcare professional about their medications.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ينصحك المعهد الوطني للطب باستشارة طبيب مؤهل للحصول على نصيحة حول الأدوية."
          }
